  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d1c502f6227264d9f66cdbb133db36, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialTrigger
  tutorialText: {fileID: 584707457}
  tutorialAnimator: {fileID: 837100328}
  tutorialIndex: 0
  textList:
  - Where work becomes your journey!
  - This is a timer section!
  - You can adjust your work time here.
  - After that, You can start by 'Focus'.
  - You can break after each session with buff.
  - This is the resources you have.
  - Distance shows how far you go.
  - Fish can be use for shopping.
  - Your diaries written along the way.
  - This button is for go fishing.
  - I will follow your cursor until I catch fishes.
  - After that, You have to click it to drag it up!
  - Get the fish before I run out of stamina.
  - This is for entering shop.
  - Turn on/off audio here!
  - Lastly, This's for toggle always on top.
